<description>&lt;p&gt;Cameroon’s BIR rapid intervention force has expanded its presence around Lake Chad, while the government continues to deploy drones and joint border patrols in the Anglophone regions. Survivors of the Eseka rail disaster are still waiting for justice ten years after the crash. A French court has greenlit a third-party funder’s enforcement of an ICC award against Cameroon. President Paul Biya, aged 93, remains in office despite frequent absences. The conflict caused 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/eye-on-africa/20261021-sudan-s-war-escalates-as-un-warns-of-wider-regional-crisis&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxQU1l5WXBqS0JMNU5uZEFZY2s1UURDQ2N2bDhwSnQxUnlUUjNYVEZQclR6NWh6Sk9yajVUN1JnMHYzYUhNWkxsU01kTm1FSW5NY25keWl2SE00Q2VaWlF6cy1RR3RmS3JNSFVZSVJtX3JBcVFRX1BXUGZ2TG5KTHFhVU5LNVBGcFVVbXNFMUNNek94dDRjUHEweFIteGNYaXJMVWJXOWZfU19zOWR4NHQ4LTRnUnFMd3VsOUxEZ2xtdTAtc3ktYVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE96OWlXZnVfekhWckgwaDBDbHQzR0dsbFFwOExVRmZZcEZOSm5lN0lJSHVUM1Y4OUhuSVdkdi00ejU4a2VHVDdwWFhQMHV1aG00RWRjZlI3OXBaZDA?oc=5&quot;&gt;allAfrica.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Economic Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE11cnhlVm5XUmt1MUdyWjNQRmM1SlhaYk5hM1ktSU9rWEc0Z211SmJFS2daU1B1NW8wU0FCRWJMazN5UXZNN1pBTjgzcGFvVE9wTFdmYUJkUXhZcWUwbnlxVjJPY1MwWTM1bk5OdUdjZTVjRWtmUXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Sun Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxNd1pXTXFLS0MtT2ZWc0M4dWpEY2h2QnFiUGI0ejNoOUxOcWswSFBkVXdzRmhST1Y0OUstell0M2tBTWpteTJXTWV6YXFPQWRQeTZCSEtCV2FfcS1wRzF2V01lRGFvai1TVGU2d29UbF